  "content": "<div style=\"padding-top: 1rem; padding-bottom: 2rem;\">\n  <!-- Hero -->\n  <div style=\"border: 3px solid var(--ink); padding: 2.5rem; background: var(--card-bg); margin-bottom: 3rem;\">\n    <span class=\"hero-tag\" style=\"display: inline-block; background: var(--ke-green); color: #fff; padding: 0.2rem 0.6rem; fontSize: 0.65rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 700; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.1em; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n      🇰🇪 Local Sourcing Pledge\n    </span>\n    <h1 style=\"font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.8rem); font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1.1; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">\n      Fresher. Cheaper. <em style=\"font-style: italic; color: var(--ke-red);\">Kenyan Sourced.</em>\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"font-size: 1.05rem; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--ink-light); max-width: 800px; margin: 0;\">\n      Did you know imported pet food spends up to <strong>6 months</strong> inside hot shipping containers and customs clearance before reaching Kenyan shelves? This heat and time degrades vital proteins, fats, and vitamin content. \n      By choosing <strong>PetStore Kenya</strong>, you bypass imports, support Kenyan farmers and fishers, and feed your pet food manufactured right here in Kenya that reaches your bowl within days.\n    </p>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Grid of Partners -->\n  <div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 2.5rem;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-mono); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 0;\">\n      🤝 Our Local Manufacturing Partners\n    </h2>\n\n    <!-- Partner 1 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card-bg);\">\n      <div style=\"background: var(--ke-green); color: #fff; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;\">\n        <span>🎣 SOURCED FROM LAKE VICTORIA</span>\n        <span>📍 Kisumu & Homa Bay 🐟</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 2rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\">PARTNER #1 · Omena Foods (Robeliz / Perfect Mix)</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">Lake Victoria Fishery Communities</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">What they do</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">Our premium Omena products are sourced directly from small-scale local fishers on the shores of Lake Victoria. Sun-dried under strict hygienic standards, this omena is a nutrient-dense powerhouse packed with Omega-3, calcium, and proteins.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--tan-light); padding-left: 1.25rem;\">\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ke-green); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">Community Impact</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;\">Every purchase directly supports lakeside families, promoting sustainable fishing and bypassing greedy middle-men to deliver fair value to local fishers.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Partner 2 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card-bg);\">\n      <div style=\"background: var(--ke-red); color: #fff; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;\">\n        <span>🍗 FRESH POULTRY FARMING</span>\n        <span>📍 Nairobi Industrial Area 🐔</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 2rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\">PARTNER #2 · Bravo Pet Food</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">Sigma Foods Ltd</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">What they do</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">Sigma Foods operates a state-of-the-art poultry and animal feed facility, formulating Bravo recipes strictly to AAFCO nutritional profiles. Sourcing 100% of their ingredients locally, they ensure consistent batch-to-batch protein quality.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--tan-light); padding-left: 1.25rem;\">\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ke-red); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">Community Impact</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;\">Supports Kenyan contract poultry farmers and guarantees a high-protein, fresh kibble that hasn't degraded in transit for months.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Partner 3 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card-bg);\">\n      <div style=\"background: var(--tan); color: #fff; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;\">\n        <span>🥩 RIFT VALLEY PASTURE-RAISED BEEF</span>\n        <span>📍 Nakuru County 🐄</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 2rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\">PARTNER #3 · Pet Biltong & Jerky Treats</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">Gilani's Gourmet</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">What they do</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">With decades of experience in East African traditional air-curing and biltong crafting, Gilani's produces premium, single-ingredient treats from free-range Rift Valley cattle. Highly digestible, rich in iron, and completely chemical-free.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--tan-light); padding-left: 1.25rem;\">\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--tan); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">Community Impact</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;\">Promotes pasture-raised cattle farming in Nakuru and provides pets with biologically appropriate snacks free of artificial binders.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Partner 4 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card-bg);\">\n      <div style=\"background: var(--ink); color: #fff; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;\">\n        <span>🌾 WHOLESOME GRAIN & MEAT SOURCING</span>\n        <span>📍 Nairobi / Rift Valley Farms 🚜</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 2rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\">PARTNER #4 · Team Pet & Beef Dry Dog Food</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">Farmers Choice</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">What they do</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">The name synonymous with quality meats in Kenya. Sourcing beef meal and quality local maize and wheat germ directly from Rift Valley farmers, Farmers Choice processes and bags daily feed that reaches Nairobi pet parents within days of manufacture.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--tan-light); padding-left: 1.25rem;\">\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ke-red); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">Community Impact</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;\">Uses local agricultural products, keeping 100% of the manufacturing spend within the Kenyan economy while maintaining exceptional freshness.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Partner 5 -->\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr; border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: var(--card-bg);\">\n      <div style=\"background: var(--ink-light); color: #fff; padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem; font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.06em; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.5rem;\">\n        <span>🍚 ELDORET MILLING & VEGAN STAPLES</span>\n        <span>📍 Eldoret County 🌽</span>\n      </div>\n      <div style=\"padding: 2rem;\">\n        <div style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\">PARTNER #5 · Grain-free Dog Rice & Fortified Meals</div>\n        <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">T.L.C. & Scooby</h3>\n        <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem;\">\n          <div>\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">What they do</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">Veterinarians across Nairobi prescribe TLC Dog Rice and Scooby formulations for dogs recovering from gastrointestinal distress or managing sensitive stomachs. Clean, pre-portioned, and fortified with vitamin B complexes.</p>\n          </div>\n          <div style=\"border-left: 3px solid var(--tan-light); padding-left: 1.25rem;\">\n            <h4 style=\"font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 0.7rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.05em; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; margin-top: 0;\">Community Impact</h4>\n            <p style=\"font-size: 0.875rem; line-height: 1.65; color: var(--ink); margin: 0;\">Milled locally in the agricultural heartland of Eldoret, ensuring top-tier processing standards and grain consistency for therapeutic pet feeding.</p>\n          </div>\n        </div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Local vs Import comparison -->\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 4rem;\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; font-family: var(--font-mono); border-bottom: 3px solid var(--ink); padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; margin-top: 0;\">\n      ⚖️ Local Sourced vs. Imported Pet Food\n    </h2>\n\n    <div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(300px, 1fr)); gap: 1.5rem;\">\n      <div style=\"border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: rgba(0,102,0,0.06); padding: 1.5rem;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem;\">🇰🇪</span>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; margin: 0;\">Kenyan Local Sourced</h3>\n        </div>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5;\">\n          <li>🚀 <strong>Freshness:</strong> Reaches your dog or cat in days. High nutrient bioavailability.</li>\n          <li>💰 <strong>Price:</strong> 30% - 50% cheaper since there are no shipping containers or heavy import tariffs.</li>\n          <li>🌱 <strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong> Negligible carbon footprint from shipping miles. Sourced right here.</li>\n          <li>🤝 <strong>Community:</strong> Supports local East African poultry farmers and Lake Victoria fisheries.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n\n      <div style=\"border: 3px solid var(--ink); background: rgba(200,16,46,0.04); padding: 1.5rem; opacity: 0.85;\">\n        <div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;\">\n          <span style=\"font-size: 1.5rem;\">🚢</span>\n          <h3 style=\"font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 700; color: var(--ink-light); margin: 0;\">Imported Brands</h3>\n        </div>\n        <ul style=\"list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.5; color: var(--ink-light);\">\n          <li>⌛ <strong>Freshness:</strong> Sits in ocean cargo for 3-6 months. Preservatives added to extend shelf life.</li>\n          <li>💸 <strong>Price:</strong> Expensive. You pay for international sea freight and 25%+ customs duty.</li>\n          <li>🌍 <strong>Eco-Friendly:</strong> Large carbon footprint from transcontinental shipping and logistics.</li>\n          <li>🏢 <strong>Community:</strong> Profits go directly to overseas multinational conglomerates.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- CTA -->\n  <div style=\"margin-top: 4rem; text-align: center; border: 3px solid var(--ink); padding: 3rem 1.5rem; background: var(--card-bg);\">\n    <h2 style=\"font-size: 1.8rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 1rem; margin-top: 0;\">Support Local, Save Big Today</h2>\n    <p style=\"color: var(--ink-light); margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 600px; margin: 0 auto 2rem;\">\n      Feed your pets high-quality, fresher food while supporting our local Kenyan manufacturing partners. Free Nairobi delivery for orders over KES 5,000.\n    </p>\n    <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n      <a href=\"/shop\" class=\"btn-primary\" style=\"padding: 0.75rem 2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; background: var(--ke-red); border-color: var(--ke-red); color: #fff; text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; border-width: 3px; border-style: solid;\">\n        🛒 Shop Local Pet Food\n      </a>\n      <a href=\"https://wa.me/254795350292?text=Hi%20PetStore%20Kenya%2C%20I%27d%20like%20to%20order!\" class=\"btn-outline\" style=\"padding: 0.75rem 2rem; font-size: 0.95rem; border: 3px solid var(--ink); color: var(--ink); text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; font-weight: 700;\">\n        📱 Order on WhatsApp\n      </a>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
